; Update where the player is and whether the player can see
;
; Stores the player's location in PlayerLocation and sets SightState (#R$980C)
; to 0 when the player can see (#R$95ED returns carry clear) or to 1 when it is
; too dark. #R$980E uses SightState for the "You hear a noise." rule: it goes to 2
; once that message has been printed in a turn. Called at the start of every turn
; and after the player has been carried to a new place (#R$9BDD).
;
; Uses the actor in Subject ($B6EA) through #R$95ED, which returns at once for
; any actor but the player.
@label=UpdatePlayerSight
@isub=LD A,PLAYER
c$9B02 LD A,$00      ;
 $9B04 CALL $9F82    ; the player's location
 $9B07 LD ($B6F5),A  ; PlayerLocation
 $9B0A CALL $95ED    ; carry set: too dark to see
 $9B0D LD A,$00      ;
 $9B0F JR NC,$9B12   ;
 $9B11 INC A         ; 1 when dark
*$9B12 LD ($980C),A  ; SightState
 $9B15 RET           ;
